DESCRIPTION:Conference title: ACM SIGKDD Conference on Knowledge Discovery 
 and Data Mining\nWebsite: https://kdd2026.kdd.org/\nSource URL: https://k
 dd2026.kdd.org/research-track-call-for-papers/\nLocation: Jeju\, Korea\nT
 opics: Data Mining & Data Science\, Machine Learning\, Time Series & Sequ
 ential Data\, Federated & Distributed Learning\nSize: XL\nSubmission type
 : Paper-based / mixed tracks\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2
 026-08-20\nNotes: Official SIGKDD and KDD 2026 pages list conference date
 s and research-track Cycle 2 deadlines.\nScope: Knowledge discovery and d
 ata science\, centered on extracting useful structure from large\, hetero
 geneous data. Characteristic areas include clustering\, structured and re
 lational learning\, graph and text mining\, recommender systems\, scalabl
 e data analysis\, and responsible data use. Generative AI is relevant whe
 n it advances data science\, not simply because a paper uses an LLM.\nAdd
 itional topics: Deep Representation Learning\, Natural Language Processin
 g & LLMs\, Explainability & Interpretability\, Privacy-preserving ML\, ML
  Systems & Infrastructure\nScope sources (2027): https://kdd2027.kdd.org/
 research-track-call-for-papers/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
