SUMMARY:[Deep Representation Learning][Machine Learning] ICLR 2027 - Abstra
 ct submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Conference on Learning Represen
 tations\nWebsite: https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2027\nSource URL: https://i
 clr.cc/Conferences/2027\nLocation: San Francisco\, California\, USA\nTopi
 cs: Deep Representation Learning\, Machine Learning\, Explainability & In
 terpretability\, Robustness & Safety\nSize: XXL\nSubmission type: Paper-b
 ased / OpenReview\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-08-20\n
 Notes: Official ICLR 2027 and OpenReview pages list San Francisco\, Apr 2
 6-30\, 2027\, and the abstract/paper deadlines.\nScope: Learning represen
 tations and understanding deep learning\, with an emphasis on self-superv
 ised learning\, generative models\, transfer and meta-learning\, and the 
 optimization and theory of learned representations. Language\, vision\, p
 robabilistic modeling\, and reinforcement learning are substantial areas\
 , rather than unrelated application-domain tags.\nAdditional topics: Lear
 ning Theory & Statistical Foundations\, Probabilistic\, Causal & Uncertai
 nty ML\, Reinforcement Learning\, Natural Language Processing & LLMs\, Co
 mputer Vision & Pattern Recognition\, ML Systems & Infrastructure\nScope 
 sources (2027): https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2027/CallForPapers\nScope las
 t checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2027
